      "Explains pytest discovery rules for files, functions, classes, and methods.",
      "Provides fixture, scope, conftest, and parametrization examples for reusable test setup.",
      "Documents coverage commands, threshold checks, and terminal, HTML, and XML reports.",
      "Covers FastAPI TestClient, async httpx clients, dependency overrides, authentication, uploads, WebSockets, and background tasks.",
      "Includes a Python helper script for common pytest modes such as quick, full, coverage, failed, and watch."
